Package: stern
Type: Package
Title: Editorial Design System and Reporting Helpers for Civic-Data Projects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Emily", "Stern", , "stern.emily06@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A coordinated visual language and a growing set of
    reporting helpers for public-interest data work. Includes 'ggplot2'
    themes, color scales, 'Shiny' components built on 'bslib', and a
    'Highcharter' theme. Future modules will cover project intros and
    summary panels.
